@ContosoPizza_HostAddress = https://localhost:7084

### Listar pizzas
GET {{ContosoPizza_HostAddress}}/Pizza
Accept: application/json

###

### Buscar pizza por ID
GET {{ContosoPizza_HostAddress}}/Pizza/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Criar pizza
POST {{ContosoPizza_HostAddress}}/Pizza
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Calabresa",
  "isGlutenFree": false
}

###

### Atualizar pizza
PUT {{ContosoPizza_HostAddress}}/Pizza/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "name": "Calabresa Atualizada",
  "isGlutenFree": false
}

###

### Excluir pizza
DELETE {{ContosoPizza_HostAddress}}/Pizza/1

###